# Cloudflare Pages response headers (Vercel uses vercel.json for the same thing).
# COOP/COEP make the page cross-origin isolated so speech recognition can run multithreaded WASM. Do not remove.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless

# The member manual is opened by the browser's PDF viewer or a PDF extension (e.g. Acrobat), which COEP would block
/manual.pdf
  ! Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy
  ! Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy
